 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nNordiska Verktyg AB                                  MASTER SERVICES\nIndustrivägen 3, 411 05 Göteborg, Sweden                    AGREEMENT\nMomsreg.nr: SE866040091301\n\nFROM                                                     FAKTURERAS TILL\nNordiska Verktyg AB                                      Svea Logistik AB\nIndustrivägen 3                                          Industrivägen 3\n411 05 Göteborg                                          411 05 Göteborg\nSweden                                                   Sweden\nVAT: SE866040091301\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 2026-02-07 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Nordiska Verktyg AB, with its registered office at Industrivägen 3, Göteborg\n(\"Party A\"), and Svea Logistik AB, with its registered office at Industrivägen 3, Göteborg (\"Party\nB\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\n Party A  Nordiska Verktyg AB / Anna Söderberg\n Party B  Svea Logistik AB / Erik Lindqvist\n Date     2026-02-07",
